  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For unique solution <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Applying&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Clearly, point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> satisfying the given condition.</p>",
